    "[The Graveyard Temporalis]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "A copse of trees stands still and silent, each one gnarled and twisted, laden with black leaves and blacker bark, reaching skyward with rictus limbs.  The subtle, inward curve of the mass of trunks, branches, and dark bowers serves as a stark background to a few mausoleums in a uniform arrangement, with the grass that is visible beneath the swirling mists well manicured despite its sallow appearance."
